  "Faux : zⁿ = z̄ a n + 2 solutions, 0 et les racines (n + 1)-ièmes de 1. Par exemple z³ = z̄ en a 5. Ce n'est pas un polynôme en z.": "False: zⁿ = z̄ has n + 2 solutions, 0 and the (n + 1)-th roots of 1. For example z³ = z̄ has 5. It is not a polynomial in z.",
  "Pour tout n ≥ 1, les solutions de zⁿ = |z| sont exactement les racines n-ièmes de 1.": "For every n ≥ 1, the solutions of zⁿ = |z| are exactly the n-th roots of 1.",
  "Faux : z = 0 est aussi solution (0ⁿ = 0 = |0|), et ce n'est pas une racine de l'unité. Pour tout n, par exemple n = 2.": "False: z = 0 is also a solution (0ⁿ = 0 = |0|), and it is not a root of unity. For every n, for example n = 2.",
  "Pour tout réel c > 0, les solutions non nulles de {zn} = c·z̄ ont pour module c.": "For every real c > 0, the non-zero solutions of {zn} = c·z̄ have modulus c.",
  "Faux : les modules donnent {rn} = c·r, donc {rn1} = c et r = c^(1/{k}), qui vaut c seulement pour c = 1. Par exemple c = {c} : r = 2.": "False: the moduli give {rn} = c·r, so {rn1} = c and r = c^(1/{k}), which equals c only for c = 1. For example c = {c}: r = 2.",
  "L'équation {zn} = |z| a exactement {k} solutions dans ℂ.": "The equation {zn} = |z| has exactly {k} solutions in ℂ.",
  "Vrai : r = 0 donne z = 0 ; pour r > 0, {rn1} = 1 et {n}φ = 2kπ : les {n} racines {n}-ièmes de 1. En tout {k}.": "True: r = 0 gives z = 0; for r > 0, {rn1} = 1 and {n}φ = 2kπ: the {n} {n}-th roots of 1. In total {k}.",
  "Toute solution non nulle de {zn} = z̄ est de module 1.": "Every non-zero solution of {zn} = z̄ has modulus 1.",
  "Vrai : les modules donnent {rn} = r ; si r ≠ 0, {rn1} = 1, donc r = 1.": "True: the moduli give {rn} = r; if r ≠ 0, {rn1} = 1, so r = 1.",
  "L'équation {zn} = {c}z̄ a exactement {k} solutions dans ℂ.": "The equation {zn} = {c}z̄ has exactly {k} solutions in ℂ.",
  "Vrai : z = 0, et pour r > 0 : {rn1} = {c} et {n1}φ = 2kπ, soit {n1} solutions de module {mod}.": "True: z = 0, and for r > 0: {rn1} = {c} and {n1}φ = 2kπ, giving {n1} solutions of modulus {mod}.",
